[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24542.628, "timestamp": "06:49:02", "text": "放棄你辛苦創造的獨立智慧財產權，對吧？因為那是你的作品集，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24552.468, "timestamp": "06:49:12", "text": "你為了加入公司或被公司接受而保留的東西，對吧？去做那種，呃，該怎麼稱呼呢，呃，試鏡影片之類的，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24577.03, "timestamp": "06:49:37", "text": "對我來說，我不想，我不想那樣做，Jocknik是我的一切，我的生命，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24583.628, "timestamp": "06:49:43", "text": "血液，我的一切，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24586.628, "timestamp": "06:49:46", "text": "我不想僅僅因為這個就放棄"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24589.43, "timestamp": "06:49:49", "text": "Jocknik。當然，我本來可以那樣做，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24592.83, "timestamp": "06:49:52", "text": "但我從來沒有，也從來沒有想過要那樣做"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 24593.551, "timestamp": "06:49:53", "author": "@mimmumimamo", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7PMal4y_Mk--8aI5vTwHB0Abiq0ArNTsVnMzjhb5Wed79Ez0lSwROf6lXVH7CWgscrM5jTOUScU=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "premade characters?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24595.868, "timestamp": "06:49:55", "text": "。所以，因此，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 24599.317, "timestamp": "06:49:59", "author": "@Astro-9999", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/I0atDf8aJGAiY3Z-U4COpBQFW4_qYnJ5GkhRqDK8dE_sjbhzV3NcVv5LuXD4hdY7IHeyOXW2OQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "isoke you can make it"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24599.91, "timestamp": "06:49:59", "text": "嗯，因此我從來沒有想過要"}]